			"name": "Guns",
			"local_notes": "Human-pattern boltgun.\n\nDesign: Sisters of Silence carry boltguns alongside flamers and greatblades (Codex: Adeptus Custodes background). DX 13 + 3 for 8 points: Guns (Rifle)-16. Replaces an earlier Psyniscience entry: a Pariah is soulless and cannot sense the warp, and Psyniscience needs Psyker talent under this project's rules.",
